@startuml
[*] --> Initial
Initial --> Greeting : User Arrives
Greeting --> CardInserted : Insert Card
CardInserted --> PINCheck : Check PIN
PINCheck --> PINCorrect : Correct
PINCorrect --> DisplayOptions : Display Options
DisplayOptions --> Processing : Choose Option
Processing --> [*] : Complete Transaction

CardInserted --> IncorrectPINAttempt : Incorrect
IncorrectPINAttempt --> CardRetained : Retain Card
CardRetained --> Initial : Cancel Operation

PINCheck --> CardRetained : Invalid Card
@enduml
